; One variable: the option that decides whether or where a clipped TabBar scrolls to its current tab
; (tab_bar.cpp:1875-1920). Every bar has a late current tab. Bars vary scroll_to_selected, clip_tabs,
; layout_direction, a disabled tab ahead of it, an icon, max_tab_width and a tab wider
; than the bar. unit-tab-bar-scroll-to-current shows the plain case, so none of these shows a regression there.

